-beta-2\">Publish from Cinema 4D (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from houdini (beta)\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-houdini\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-houdini-beta-2\">Publish from Houdini (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from solidworks (beta)\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-solidworks\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-solidworks-beta-2\">Publish from SolidWorks (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from spline, and figma (beta)\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-spline\" aria-current=\"page\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-spline-and-figma-beta-2\">Publish from Spline, and Figma (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"camera paths and default walkthroughs\" href=\"/docs/guides/camera-paths\" id=\"lnk-camera-paths-and-default-walkthroughs-2\">Camera paths and default walkthroughs</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"hotspots and doors\" href=\"/docs/guides/hotspots-and-doors\" id=\"lnk-hotspots-and-doors-2\">Hotspots and doors</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse capture: film a room (beta)\" href=\"/docs/guides/film-a-room\" id=\"lnk-verse-capture-film-a-room-beta-2\">Verse Capture: film a room (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse play: host a web game\" href=\"/docs/guides/host-a-web-game\" id=\"lnk-verse-play-host-a-web-game-2\">Verse Play: host a web game</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"spatial bench\" href=\"/docs/guides/spatial-bench\" id=\"lnk-spatial-bench-2\">Spatial Bench</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"light and dark theme\" href=\"/docs/guides/light-and-dark-theme\" id=\"lnk-light-and-dark-theme-2\">Light and dark theme</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"share privately with tokens\" href=\"/docs/guides/share-privately\" id=\"lnk-share-privately-with-tokens-2\">Share privately with tokens</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"show your clients who looked\" href=\"/docs/guides/analytics\" id=\"lnk-show-your-clients-who-looked-2\">Show your clients who looked</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed anywhere: wordpress, shopify, webflow\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-anywhere\" id=\"lnk-embed-anywhere-wordpress-shopify-webflow-2\">Embed anywhere: WordPress, Shopify, Webflow</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse for commerce: 3d on product pages (woocommerce, magento, bigcommerce, salesforce)\" href=\"/docs/guides/commerce\" id=\"lnk-verse-for-commerce-3d-on-product-pages-w-2\">Verse for Commerce: 3D on product pages (WooCommerce, Magento, BigCommerce, Salesforce)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse links and embeds: embed the viewer\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-the-viewer\" id=\"lnk-verse-links-and-embeds-embed-the-viewer-2\">Verse links and embeds: embed the viewer</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"export a flythrough video\" href=\"/docs/guides/export-video\" id=\"lnk-export-a-flythrough-video-2\">Export a flythrough video</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"collect client review comments\" href=\"/docs/guides/collect-review-comments\" id=\"lnk-collect-client-review-comments-2\">Collect client review comments</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"author a guided tour\" href=\"/docs/guides/author-a-guided-tour\" id=\"lnk-author-a-guided-tour-2\">Author a guided tour</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"video on surfaces, sound in the room\" href=\"/docs/guides/video-and-audio\" id=\"lnk-video-on-surfaces-sound-in-the-room-2\">Video on surfaces, sound in the room</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from ifc or usd\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-ifc\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-ifc-or-usd-2\">Publish from IFC or USD</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"upload fbx and obj\" href=\"/docs/guides/upload-fbx-obj\" id=\"lnk-upload-fbx-and-obj-2\">Upload FBX and OBJ</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"build a configurator\" href=\"/docs/guides/build-a-configurator\" id=\"lnk-build-a-configurator-2\">Build a configurator</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"present a scene to a room\" href=\"/docs/guides/present-a-scene\" id=\"lnk-present-a-scene-to-a-room-2\">Present a scene to a room</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse-prepare: the local compression step\" href=\"/docs/guides/verse-prepare\" id=\"lnk-verse-prepare-the-local-compression-step-2\">verse-prepare: the local compression step</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"tune quality knobs\" href=\"/docs/guides/tune-quality\" id=\"lnk-tune-quality-knobs-2\">Tune quality knobs</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"run your own server\" href=\"/docs/guides/run-your-own-server\" id=\"lnk-run-your-own-server-2\">Run your own server</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"monitor production\" href=\"/docs/guides/monitor-production\" id=\"lnk-monitor-production-2\">Monitor production</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"ask verse, the site assistant\" href=\"/docs/guides/ask-verse\" id=\"lnk-ask-verse-the-site-assistant-2\">Ask Verse, the site assistant</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse home: floor plan to 3d home\" href=\"/docs/guides/floor-plan-to-3d\" id=\"lnk-verse-home-floor-plan-to-3d-home-2\">Verse Home: floor plan to 3D home</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse home: plan to a home buyers walk, restyle and tour\" href=\"/docs/guides/instant-home\" id=\"lnk-verse-home-plan-to-a-home-buyers-walk-re-2\">Verse Home: plan to a home buyers walk, restyle and tour</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"&lt;verse-viewer&gt;: one tag, any page\" href=\"/docs/guides/web-component\" id=\"lnk-one-tag-any-page-2\">&lt;verse-viewer&gt;: one tag, any page</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"designer tools: framer, webflow, figma\" href=\"/docs/guides/designer-tools\" id=\"lnk-designer-tools-framer-webflow-figma-2\">Designer tools: Framer, Webflow, Figma</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"react and vue wrappers\" href=\"/docs/guides/react-and-vue\" id=\"lnk-react-and-vue-wrappers-2\">React and Vue wrappers</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"rest client round trip\" href=\"/docs/guides/rest-client\" id=\"lnk-rest-client-round-trip-2\">REST client round trip</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"sell with woocommerce\" href=\"/docs/guides/sell-with-woocommerce\" id=\"lnk-sell-with-woocommerce-2\">Sell with WooCommerce</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"sell with bigcommerce\" href=\"/docs/guides/sell-with-bigcommerce\" id=\"lnk-sell-with-bigcommerce-2\">Sell with BigCommerce</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"sell with magento / adobe commerce\" href=\"/docs/guides/sell-with-magento\" id=\"lnk-sell-with-magento-adobe-commerce-2\">Sell with Magento / Adobe Commerce</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in wix\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-wix\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-wix-2\">Embed in Wix</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in squarespace\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-squarespace\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-squarespace-2\">Embed in Squarespace</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in framer\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-framer\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-framer-2\">Embed in Framer</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in ghost and hubspot\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-ghost-and-hubspot\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-ghost-and-hubspot-2\">Embed in Ghost and HubSpot</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"automate with zapier\" href=\"/docs/guides/automate-with-zapier\" id=\"lnk-automate-with-zapier-2\">Automate with Zapier</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"automate with make\" href=\"/docs/guides/automate-with-make\" id=\"lnk-automate-with-make-2\">Automate with Make</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"automate with n8n\" href=\"/docs/guides/automate-with-n8n\" id=\"lnk-automate-with-n8n-2\">Automate with n8n</a></section><section id=\"sec-item-10\"><h2>Blog & updates</h2><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"all posts\" href=\"/docs/blog/index\" id=\"lnk-all-posts-2\">All posts</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"how verse streams a building\" href=\"/docs/blog/how-verse-streams-a-building\" id=\"lnk-how-verse-streams-a-building-2\">How Verse streams a building</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"2.7: what's new for you\" href=\"/docs/blog/verse-engine-2-7-whats-new\" id=\"lnk-2-7-what-s-new-for-you-2\">2.7: what's new for you</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"2.0 release notes for humans\" href=\"/docs/blog/2-0-release-notes-for-humans\" id=\"lnk-2-0-release-notes-for-humans-2\">2.0 release notes for humans</a></section><section id=\"sec-item-11\"><h2>Integrations</h2><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"integrations: every platform at a glance\" href=\"/docs/integrations\" id=\"lnk-integrations-every-platform-at-a-glance-2\">Integrations: every platform at a glance</a></section><section id=\"sec-item-12\"><h2>API & SDK</h2><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse api, sdk and mcp: embed, sdk, webhooks\" href=\"/docs/developers\" id=\"lnk-verse-api-sdk-and-mcp-embed-sdk-webhooks-2\">Verse API, SDK and MCP: embed, SDK, webhooks</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse api reference\" href=\"/docs/api\" id=\"lnk-verse-api-reference-2\">Verse API reference</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"api quickstart\" href=\"/docs/api-quickstart\" id=\"lnk-api-quickstart-2\">API quickstart</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"api changelog\" href=\"/docs/api-changelog\" id=\"lnk-api-changelog-2\">API changelog</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed sdk reference\" href=\"/docs/embed-sdk\" id=\"lnk-embed-sdk-reference-2\">Embed SDK reference</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse sdk: js / ts (@ctruhtech/verse-sdk)\" href=\"/docs/sdk\" id=\"lnk-verse-sdk-js-ts-ctruhtech-verse-sdk-2\">Verse SDK: JS / TS (@ctruhtech/verse-sdk)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse mcp server for ai agents\" href=\"/docs/mcp\" id=\"lnk-verse-mcp-server-for-ai-agents-2\">Verse MCP server for AI agents</a></section><p class=\"docs-no-results\" hidden>No matching guides.</p></div></nav></aside><div class=\"doc-body\"><article class=\"doc-article\" id=\"art-doc-article\"><h1 id=\"publish-from-spline-and-put-the-link-in-figma\">Publish from Spline (and put the link in Figma)<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#publish-from-spline-and-put-the-link-in-figma\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section\">#</a></h1>\n<blockquote><p>**Status: 4.0.0-beta.1 — the Spline path works today through the existing\nuploaders; the Figma plug-in is a skeleton.<strong> Spline has </strong>no editor\nplug-in API**, so there is no Verse button inside Spline. A GLB exported\nfrom Spline publishes like any GLB. The Figma plug-in&#39;s <em>Insert a Verse\nlink</em> works with any server; its <em>Publish a GLB</em> uses an upload core that\nwas tested in Node against a real local Verse server (one-shot, resumable,\nresize, dead server, cancel; <code>web/test/fix-verify-aec.mjs</code>), but **from\ninside Figma it needs the server to accept cross-origin uploads, which\ntoday&#39;s server does not** (below). Nothing has been run inside Figma yet.</p></blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"spline-verse\">Spline → Verse<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#spline-verse\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-2\">#</a></h2>\n<ol><li>In Spline: <strong>Export ▸ 3D formats ▸ glTF</strong> and download the binary\n<strong><code>.glb</code></strong> (a multi-file <code>.gltf</code> must be zipped with its files, or\nre-exported as GLB).</li><li>Publish the file, any of these ways:\n<ul><li>drop it on the Verse upload screen in the browser;</li><li><code>python3 integrations/aec/shared/python/verse_upload.py scene.glb --server https://verse.ctruh.com</code>\n(prints the link; <code>--open</code> opens it);</li><li>the Figma plug-in below, if your server accepts uploads from it.</li></ul></li><li>Check the size with the viewer&#39;s measure tool. Spline does not state a\nunit for its scenes; if the object comes out far too large, publish again\nfrom the Figma plug-in with <strong>Size ▸ 1 unit = 1 cm (÷100)</strong> (or ÷1000).\nThis wraps the scene in one scale node; nothing else changes.</li></ol>\n<p>Spline-only features — states, events, interactions, the Spline runtime&#39;s\nmaterials — are not part of a GLB and do not come across. Plain PBR\nmaterials and textures do.</p>\n<h2 id=\"1-install-the-figma-plug-in\">1. Install the Figma plug-in<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#1-install-the-figma-plug-in\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-3\">#</a></h2>\n<ol><li>Download <strong><code>VersePublish-Figma-4.0.0-beta.1.zip</code></strong> from the\n<a href=\"https://verse.ctruh.com/downloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" id=\"lnk-downloads-page\">downloads page</a> (or build it:\n<code>sh integrations/aec/figma/make_package.sh</code>) and unzip it.</li><li>In the Figma <strong>desktop</strong> app: **Plugins ▸ Development ▸ Import plugin\nfrom manifest…** and pick <code>manifest.json</code>.</li><li>Run <strong>Plugins ▸ Development ▸ Verse Publish</strong>; set the server URL (and an\nAPI key / account token if you have them).</li></ol>\n<p><strong>Success looks like:</strong> <em>Insert a Verse link</em> puts the link on the canvas\nas hyperlinked text; clicking it opens the 3D scene in the browser.</p>\n<h2 id=\"the-figma-plug-in\">The Figma plug-in<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#the-figma-plug-in\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-4\">#</a></h2>\n<p>Figma is a 2D tool; the useful thing a plug-in can do is put the 3D link on\nthe canvas next to the design.</p>\n<ul><li><strong>Insert a Verse link:</strong> paste a link, it lands on the canvas as\nhyperlinked text. Works today.</li><li><strong>Publish a GLB</strong> (for example a Spline export) with a <em>Size</em> choice,\nprogress and <strong>Cancel</strong>, then insert its link. **Blocked on the server\ntoday:** a Figma plug-in&#39;s UI runs with origin <code>null</code>, and an upload with\nVerse&#39;s headers needs a CORS preflight; <code>OPTIONS /v1/ingest</code> answers 404\nwithout <code>Access-Control-*</code> headers. Allowing cross-origin uploads to\n<code>/v1/ingest*</code> is a product and security decision (any web page could then\nupload from a visitor&#39;s browser), so it has not been changed. Until it is,\nthe plug-in says: <em>&quot;Could not reach the Verse server … (From Figma this also\nhappens when the server does not accept uploads from plug-ins …)&quot;</em>.</li></ul>\n<p><strong>Settings.</strong> Figma sandboxes plug-ins, so the plug-in cannot read the\n<code>settings.json</code> the desktop plug-ins share; its server URL, API key and\ntoken are kept in Figma&#39;s per-user plug-in storage (<code>figma.clientStorage</code>).\nA self-hosted server must also be added to <code>networkAccess.allowedDomains</code> in\n<code>manifest.json</code>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"troubleshooting\">Troubleshooting<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#troubleshooting\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-5\">#</a></h2>\n<p>Every problem ends in one sentence; the first words tell you which row applies.</p>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>You see</th><th>What it means</th><th>Do this</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><em>&quot;Could not reach the Verse server at … (From Figma this also happens when the server does not accept uploads from plug-ins …)&quot;</em></td><td>From inside Figma: the server does not accept cross-origin uploads (true of verse.ctruh.com today). Otherwise a wrong URL or no internet.</td><td>Publish the GLB with the upload card or <code>verse_upload.py</code> and use <em>Insert a Verse link</em>; check the server URL.</td></tr><tr><td><em>&quot;The Verse server at … did not recognise the account token …&quot;</em></td><td>The token is mistyped, revoked, or from another server. Nothing was uploaded.</td><td>Copy it again from <strong>Studio</strong>, or clear it.</td></tr><tr><td><em>&quot;The server did not accept your API key or account token …&quot;</em></td><td>The server only takes uploads with an API key.</td><td>Enter the key from the server&#39;s operator.</td></tr><tr><td><em>&quot;Upload limit reached: …&quot;</em></td><td>The hourly upload limit, or the key&#39;s daily quota.</td><td>Wait as the sentence says, or add an account token.</td></tr><tr><td><em>&quot;The server is busy right now. …&quot;</em> / <em>&quot;The server is out of storage. …&quot;</em></td><td>The server&#39;s build queue or disk is full. Your file is fine.</td><td>Publish again in a few minutes.</td></tr><tr><td><em>&quot;Only a binary glTF (.glb) can be resized here.&quot;</em></td><td><em>Size</em> was set for a file that is not a GLB.</td><td>Export GLB from Spline, or publish at the exported size.</td></tr><tr><td><em>&quot;Verse cannot build … files yet. Export the model as GLB (or FBX / OBJ) and publish that file instead.&quot;</em></td><td>A STEP / CAD file was picked.</td><td>Export GLB and publish that.</td></tr><tr><td>The model is 100× too big</td><td>Spline wrote centimetres.</td><td>Publish again with <strong>Size ▸ 1 unit = 1 cm (÷100)</strong>.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"what-has-been-tested\">What has been tested<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#what-has-been-tested\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-6\">#</a></h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th></th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>A GLB published by the shared CLI / upload screen</td><td>tested (every 4.0 gate)</td></tr><tr><td>Figma upload core: slug, URL rule, resize, STEP / empty sentences, resumable part order — offline; GLB one-shot, resumable, ÷100 cube, dead server, cancel — against a real local server</td><td>tested</td></tr><tr><td>The Figma UI, inserting the link, clientStorage inside Figma</td><td><strong>needs a real install</strong></td></tr><tr><td>Publishing from inside Figma</td><td><strong>blocked on server CORS</strong> for <code>/v1/ingest*</code></td></tr><tr><td>A real Spline export&#39;s units and materials</td><td><strong>needs a real Spline export</strong></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h2 id=\"next\">Next<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#next\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-7\">#</a></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/docs/guides/what-you-can-upload\" id=\"lnk-what-you-can-upload-3\">What you can upload</a> · <a href=\"/docs/guides/fidelity-mode\" id=\"lnk-fidelity-mode-for-products\">Fidelity mode for products</a> · <a href=\"/docs/guides/embed-anywhere\" id=\"lnk-embed-anywhere\">Embed anywhere</a></li></ul></article><div class=\"doc-source\">Published documentation from <a href=\"https://verse.ctruh.com/docs/#/guides/publish-from-spline\" id=\"lnk-verse-by-ctruh\">Verse by Ctruh</a></div></div><aside class=\"docs-toc\" id=\"asd-docs-toc\"><p>ON THIS PAGE</p><a href=\"#spline-verse\" id=\"lnk-spline-verse\">Spline → Verse</a><a href=\"#1-install-the-figma-plug-in\" id=\"lnk-1-install-the-figma-plug-in\">1. Install the Figma plug-in</a><a href=\"#the-figma-plug-in\" id=\"lnk-the-figma-plug-in\">The Figma plug-in</a><a href=\"#troubleshooting\" id=\"lnk-troubleshooting\">Troubleshooting</a><a href=\"#what-has-been-tested\" id=\"lnk-what-has-been-tested\">What has been tested</a><a href=\"#next\" id=\"lnk-next\">Next</a></aside></section>"}